      "title": "erf: Suppress Coverity false positive",
      "message": "erf: Suppress Coverity false positive\n\ng_strjoin allows any string to be NULL, as it stops at the first NULL\namong the variadic arguments that it finds (and it must find one, or\nelse there is a problem). Coverity doesn't seem to know that.\n\nCoverity 1477587\n",
